{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: RAG技术MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG 系统评估指标与 RAGAS 框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"RAG技术\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> advanced\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/RAG技术\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/advanced</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/05-RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF/RAG%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AFMOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">RAG技术MOC</a></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n## 问题\nRAG 系统的评估指标体系是怎样的？RAGAS 框架的核心指标有哪些？如何构建测试集并实施评估？\n\n## 答案\n\nRAG 系统的评估需要**分层进行**，不能只看最终答案，要从检索层、生成层、端到端层分别评估。\n\n**评估指标体系：**\n\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\">┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐<br>\n│                    RAG 评估分层体系                              │<br>\n├────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┤<br>\n│  检索层指标             │ 生成层指标                              │<br>\n├────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤<br>\n│ • Hit Rate@K           │ • Faithfulness（忠实度）                 │<br>\n│ • Recall@K             │ • Answer Relevancy（答案相关性）          │<br>\n│ • Precision@K          │ • Correctness（正确性）                  │<br>\n│ • MRR                  │ • Completeness（完整性）                 │<br>\n│ • NDCG@K               │ • Harmfulness（有害性）                  │<br>\n├────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┤<br>\n│                    端到端层指标                                  │<br>\n├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤<br>\n│ • 任务完成率 / 首问解决率                                         │<br>\n│ • 用户满意度 / 人工评分                                           │<br>\n│ • 延迟 (P50/P99)                                                  │<br>\n│ • 成本 (Token 消耗 / 调用次数)                                     │<br>\n│ • 引用准确率                                                      │<br>\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">\n**核心指标详解：**\n\n**检索层指标：**\n\n| 指标 | 说明 | 计算方式 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| **Hit Rate@K** | Top-K 中是否命中相关文档 | 命中的查询数 / 总查询数 |\n| **Recall@K** | 相关文档被找回的比例 | 找回的相关文档 / 所有相关文档 |\n| **Precision@K** | Top-K 中相关文档的比例 | 相关文档 / K |\n| **MRR** | 第一个相关文档的排名倒数均值 | Σ(1/rank_i) / N |\n| **NDCG@K** | 考虑分级相关性的排序质量 | 折扣累积增益的标准化版本 |\n\n**生成层指标（RAGAS 核心）：**\n\n| 指标 | 说明 | 关注点 |\n|------|------|--------|\n| **Faithfulness** | 忠实度：答案中的声明是否能被上下文支持 | 防幻觉最关键指标 |\n| **Answer Relevancy** | 答案相关性：答案是否与问题匹配 | 防止答非所问 |\n| **Context Precision** | 上下文精度：检索结果中信噪比 | 上下文是否干净 |\n| **Context Recall** | 上下文召回率：回答所需信息是否被覆盖 | 是否漏检关键证据 |\n\n**RAGAS 使用示例：**\n\n```python\nfrom ragas import evaluate\nfrom ragas.metrics import (\n    faithfulness,\n    answer_relevancy,\n    context_precision,\n    context_recall,\n    answer_correctness\n)\nfrom datasets import Dataset\n\n# 准备测试数据（需要预先标注）\ntest_data = Dataset.from_dict({\n    \"question\": [\"什么是RAG？\", \"如何减少幻觉？\"],\n    \"answer\": [\"RAG是检索增强生成...\", \"可以通过以下方式...\"],\n    \"contexts\": [\n        [\"RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)...\"],\n        [\"幻觉是LLM编造信息的问题...\"]\n    ],\n    \"ground_truth\": [\"RAG是检索增强生成技术\", \"使用RAG和Prompt约束\"]\n})\n\n# 执行评估\nresult = evaluate(\n    dataset=test_data,\n    metrics=[\n        faithfulness,\n        answer_relevancy,\n        context_precision,\n        context_recall,\n        answer_correctness\n    ]\n)\n\nprint(result)\n# 输出示例：\n# {'faithfulness': 0.85, 'answer_relevancy': 0.92, \n#  'context_precision': 0.78, 'context_recall': 0.88,\n#  'answer_correctness': 0.82}\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Faithfulness 的计算原理：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Step 1: 将答案拆分为独立的事实声明\n  \"RAG是检索增强生成技术，由Facebook在2020年提出\"\n  → [\"RAG是检索增强生成技术\", \"RAG由Facebook在2020年提出\"]\n\nStep 2: 逐一验证每个声明是否被上下文支持\n  \"RAG是检索增强生成技术\" → ✅ 有依据\n  \"RAG由Facebook在2020年提出\" → ✅ 有依据\n\nStep 3: 计算得分\n  Faithfulness = 被支持的声明数 / 总声明数 = 2/2 = 1.0\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>测试集构建方法：</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 测试集构建流程</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">build_test_set</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> num_questions<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">100</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"\n    基于文档构建测试集\n    \"\"\"</span>\n    test_cases <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> doc <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> documents<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 使用 LLM 生成问题-答案对</span>\n        qa_pairs <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"\"\"\n        基于以下文档，生成 </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>num_questions<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\"> 个问题-答案对。\n        问题应该覆盖文档的关键信息。\n        \n        文档：</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>doc<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>page_content<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token format-spec\">2000]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\n        \n        输出格式（JSON）：\n        [\n          {{\"question\": \"...\", \"answer\": \"...\", \"source\": \"...\"}}\n        ]\n        \"\"\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        test_cases<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>extend<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>qa_pairs<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> test_cases\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>不同场景的评估侧重：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>优先指标</th>\n<th>目标值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>客服问答</td>\n<td>Faithfulness, Answer Relevancy</td>\n<td>&gt;0.85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知识检索</td>\n<td>Context Recall, Hit Rate@K</td>\n<td>&gt;0.90</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容生成</td>\n<td>Correctness, Completeness</td>\n<td>&gt;0.80</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: 如果 Recall 高但 Faithfulness 低，说明什么问题？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 说明检索召回了很多文档，但引入了大量噪声。解决方案：1) 提高相似度阈值；2) 加 Rerank 层；3) 优化 Chunk 策略；4) 做上下文压缩。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Q: RAGAS 的评估依赖 LLM，如果 LLM 判断不准确怎么办？</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A: 1) 使用更强的 LLM 做评估（如 GPT-4）；2) 对关键 Case 做人工抽检；3) 结合多个评估框架交叉验证。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>只看单一指标</strong> — RAG 评估需要多维度综合判断</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>忽略检索层评估</strong> — 只评估生成质量，不评估检索质量</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>测试集太小</strong> — 至少 100+ 个测试用例才有统计意义</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>人工评估和自动评估二选一</strong> — 最佳实践是自动评估初筛 + 人工抽检</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h3 data-heading=\"&lt;a id=&quot;q16&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Q16: 父文档-子块(Parent-Document)索引策略是什么？解决了什么问题？\" dir=\"auto\"><a id=\"q16\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"></a>Q16: 父文档-子块(Parent-Document)索引策略是什么？解决了什么问题？</h3>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"></code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>","headings":[]}